# Template: Front-End UI Enhancement

## File Purpose and Relationship

This file provides a specialized template for UI/UX enhancement requirements in the PolygonExpress project. It focuses solely on giving structure to the initial requirements.md file for UI enhancement projects.

## Usage as Project-Rule-Parameter

This file is a Manual rule type and should be referenced as a project-rule-parameter in the plan-mode message-command:

```
create-template: front-end-workflow @parameters/front-end/plan-mode/template-ui-enhancement.mdc
```

## Requirements Template

When this template is applied, it will create the following structure in requirements.md:

```markdown
# UI Enhancement Requirements

## Overview
[Provide a brief description of the UI enhancement goals here]

## Visual Requirements
[List design specifications, color schemes, and theme updates here]

Key design elements:
- [Element 1]
- [Element 2]
- [Element 3]

Color palette:
- [Primary color]: [hex code]
- [Secondary color]: [hex code]
- [Accent color]: [hex code]

## Interaction Requirements
[Describe user experience goals and interaction patterns here]

Key interactions:
- [Interaction 1]
- [Interaction 2]
- [Interaction 3]

## Accessibility Requirements
[Specify WCAG compliance targets and specific accessibility needs here]

Key accessibility features:
- [Feature 1]
- [Feature 2]
- [Feature 3]

## Browser/Device Support
[List compatibility requirements here]

Supported browsers:
- [Browser 1]: [Version]
- [Browser 2]: [Version]
- [Browser 3]: [Version]

Supported devices:
- [Device type 1]
- [Device type 2]
- [Device type 3]

## Success Criteria
[Describe how to measure successful implementation here]

Key success metrics:
- [Metric 1]
- [Metric 2]
- [Metric 3]
```

## Template Application

When the template is applied, I will:
1. Create or update requirements.md with this template
2. Leave all sections empty for completion
3. Wait for the requirements to be completed before proceeding with any planning

## Next Steps
1. Complete the requirements template with UI enhancement details
2. Once requirements are complete, proceed with planning the implementation approach

## Use Cases
- Theme updates and visual redesigns
- Accessibility improvements
- UI component library integration
- Design system implementation
- Responsive design enhancements
- Visual consistency improvements 